    "body": "The frozen factual poststate/readout fails to choose the required entry token on the 32-case transfer panel. Add an optional shared signed-H4 field that encodes the actual query followed by emitted tokens from identity, then scores every token prototype through `inverse(local state) × prototype`. Its scores join the existing full Generate/physical-Copy pool at every position; factual context and selected-source transport remain available.\n\nThe field binds the complete current Source receipt and exact Generate bytes/prototypes. Eight lanes contain960 Q4 coefficients (480 packed bytes, excluding metadata and runtime work). The Rust learner supports exact CPU/CUDA gathers, native-anchored coefficient gradients, an explicit device-resident output, and ordinary token-alias loss. No first-position gate, response lookup, supplied selected record or target mask enters the forward path. The production generalizer accepts a sealed field and records actual query/prefix states and deltas. Default callers keep the previous path.\n\nValidation:\n\n- At final head `c9a01d4e63283a24099f94f966474e17b617217a`: core and CUDA-feature training package checks, touched-file formatting, diff check and claim-wording scan pass. Focused CPU tests pass4 native field +6 native bank +6 training field +7 training bank. The separately selected CUDA test is ignored in CPU execution.\n- The hardware CUDA test passes1/1 with zero ignored on RTX4090/CUDA12.8 at `d9eafeae9541c232cdac4534b3f76d408104bb9e`, checking exact I64 scores and full120-state adjoint parity. All eight implementation blobs are unchanged at the final head. Independent nonauthor source review approves those implementation blobs.\n- Actual zero-field runtime at `112515f055a06e9c7050368ad286aa527a46c0d5` preserves8/8 original complete replies and the0/32 transfer negative. All1,087 steps retain equal scores, physical Copy aliases, states, pool actions and actual-feedback output. Native implementation blobs are unchanged at the final head. Generalizer-focused tests and release build also pass at that earlier head.\n- Full-workspace `cargo fmt --check` exits1 on eight inherited files; changed-file formatting passes. GitHub compatibility acknowledgements execute no tests.\n\nNo fitted continuation, fresh predictive improvement, whole-bank device residency, serving opcode/energy or general-chat result is claimed. The CUDA pod is released/deleted and evidence is private-HF portable with verified downloads. Detailed exact identities, retained failures, reports, reviews and cost: https://github.com/UOR-Foundation/uor-r4/issues/820#issuecomment-6046070127\n\nReferences #820.\n",
